 "body": "## Post-PR #85 hardening follow-up\n\nThis follow-up is based on the independent adversarial audit after PR #85 was merged.\n\n### Changes\n- Remove the contradictory `deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml`; the repository's canonical production compose is the root `docker-compose.prod.yml`, which CI already validates and builds with `deploy/Dockerfile.gradio`.\n- Harden `condition_parser` against sequence-repetition CPU/memory exhaustion in addition to the existing exponent cap.\n- Add regression coverage for literal/context string repetition, bounded numeric multiplication, exponent abuse, and attribute escapes.\n\n### Remaining audit item intentionally not bundled yet\nThe Gradio HITL approval-token design needs a dedicated implementation and integration test because the current boolean approval is bound to a Gradio client event. I am keeping that separate rather than introducing an unverified security primitive.\n\n### Verification\nThe branch is directly based on current `main` at merge commit `3451e6e` from PR #85.",
